        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Design assumptions (not in the record):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· AWS: us-east-1 primary, multi-AZ&lt;br&gt;· Recovery: backup and restore (SD-003)&lt;br&gt;· RTO 8h, RPO 4h (fictional objectives)&lt;br&gt;· ECS on Fargate, RDS PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;· Terraform in the engineering account&lt;br&gt;· No inbound SSH; admins use E6 only&lt;br&gt;· F17-F19 and control flows not drawn" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
